"""
Depth-Aware Trading Bot (Logic-First, ML-Second Architecture)
Requirements:
- numpy
- requests
- scikit-learn
- joblib
Architecture:
- Static Zones (the cage): Fixed dollar boundaries, rebuilt only on 3-min out-of-zone or avg shift
- Logic-First Filters: All 16 features drive explicit, interpretable rules
- ML Validation: Secondary layer that can veto or boost logic decisions, but not override hard stops
- Spring Trap: A numeric feature (0-1) fed to ML and logic. The model learns to avoid tight springs.
- Kelly Sizing: Dynamic bet sizing capped at +5% / -0%
- Paused State: Ctrl+C pauses; b/s/r/q commands bypass all filters
"""
